// v95-cssclean: CSS audit — sirf pakka dead hata diya, screen par kuch nahi badla. (1) 158 aisi classes ke rules jo JSX mein kahin use nahi: 140 Tailwind text-<rang>-<shade> (sirf ek :is/:not exclusion list mein the), tw-pc-* (purana profile card: av/name/badge/edit...), tw-hdr-add / tw-hdr-add-btn / tw-hdr-sp, tw-add-fab, tw-pill-input, min-h-[46px], tw-no-glow / tw-set-row / tw-st-plan (:where list se), button.tw-add-fab (glossy lists se). 25 rule poore hate, 6 selector-list chhoti hui. (2) ToastProvider ke inline <style> se datalist ke 2 rule (app mein <datalist> hai hi nahi). Safety: har bacha rule purane rule jaisi hi body ke saath match (501/501); :is()/:not() se member tabhi hata jab list ki specificity wahi rahi; :not(.tw-pill) / :not(.tw-pill-input) / :not(.clay-p-rose) jaan-boojh kar nahi chhue (single-member, hatane se specificity badalti). CSS 99.6 KB -> 93.2 KB. Dhyan: 'slideDownWE' animation 3 jagah (Work Entry edit/delete panel) use hoti hai par uske @keyframes kahin define nahi — wo animation chalti hi nahi; chhua nahi.
